<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-ValuJet Q2 loss estimate cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-ValuJet Q2 loss estimate cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gruntal &amp; Co said it expects a lesser second quarter loss for ValuJet Inc of $0.10 versus a previous projection of a loss of $0.20.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/32 to 6-31/32.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Steve Lewins said ValuJet management expects to have 30 aircraft aloft by the end of June.</p>
